#chip 16F877A, 20

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Minimal loop on 16F877A
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 2,500 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Flag As Bit
Dim Cnt As Byte
Dim X As Byte
Dim Y As Byte
Dim W1 As Word
Dim W2 As Word
Repeat For 500 us
    Wait 10 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
